## 7. **Pylon Feature Guarding Summary**

When `pylon = true`, the generated files include:

| Component | Pylon Enhancement |
|-----------|------------------|
| **Model** | No change (same as standard) |
| **Service** | Usage logging via `pylonService.logUsage()` |
| **Controller** | Receives full `req` object (with `userData`) |
| **Route** | `pylonService.featureGuard(dataModel, action)` middleware on CRUD routes |

**Available Feature Guards:**
- `'create'` - Allows creating records
- `'read'` - Allows reading records
- `'update'` - Allows updating records
- `'delete'` - Allows deleting records

